/-!
# Affine, triangular and Heisenberg groups

Special functions from the `ax + b` group (Gamma function, Mellin transform), the triangular group
(Whittaker functions), the Heisenberg group (Hermite and Laguerre functions, Charlier
polynomials, Fock space), the oscillator group and Miller's group `G(0, 1)` (Laguerre generating
function and addition theorem), following the roadmap `Roadmaps/AffineHeisenbergGroups/README.md`.
-/
